    len = va_arg(ap, size_t);
    if (len > max_len - 1) {
        rc = SSH_ERROR;
        break;
    }
    ...
```

Same pattern. If `max_len` is 0 (empty buffer), `max_len - 1` wraps to SIZE_MAX, and any `len` would pass.

